<scroll-view class="feature-page skin-{{skin}}" scroll-y>
  <view class="feature-hero">
    <text class="feature-kicker">YUZU SHOP</text>
    <text class="feature-title">柚子商店</text>
    <view class="balance"><text class="balance-number">{{shop.balanceDisplay}}</text><text>🍊 可用</text></view>
    <text class="feature-copy">只奖「做完了」，绝不奖「答得好」——答对答错、认识忘记都不发柚子，免得为了钱点认识、把假数据喂给 FSRS。人民币充值入口尚未接入。</text>
  </view>
  <view class="panel" wx:if="{{error}}"><text class="danger">{{error}}</text></view>

  <view class="panel">
    <text class="panel-title">怎么攒</text>
    <view class="chip-row"><text class="chip" wx:for="{{rules}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view>
    <text wx:if="{{earned}}" class="feature-copy">刚刚结算到账 {{earnedDisplay}} 枚。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="panel">
    <view class="row"><text class="panel-title">补签</text><text class="badge">{{shop.repairPriceDisplay}} 柚子</text></view>
    <text class="muted">只补最近 7 天的洞，30 天内第 1 / 2 / 3 张 500 / 1k / 2k。补回的那天接上连击，但不算成就里的学习日 —— 那天没学就是没学。</text>
    <block wx:if="{{shop.repairableDays.length}}">
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{shop.repairableDays}}" bindchange="pickRepairDay"><view class="field">补 {{repairDay}} ˅</view></picker>
      <button class="primary" disabled="{{shop.balance < shop.repairPrice}}" bindtap="repair">{{shop.balance < shop.repairPrice ? '柚子不够' : '补这一天'}}</button>
    </block>
    <text wx:else class="muted">最近 7 天没有洞。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="panel item" wx:for="{{shop.items}}" wx:key="id">
    <view class="row">
      <view><text class="list-title">{{item.name}}</text><text class="list-sub">{{item.categoryLabel}} · {{item.description}}</text><text wx:if="{{!item.localEffect && !item.soon}}" class="list-sub note">小程序里暂不显示效果，网页 / App 上生效</text></view>
      <view class="swatch {{item.swatchClass}}"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="item-actions">
      <button wx:if="{{item.action === 'soon'}}" class="soon" disabled>即将推出 · {{item.priceDisplay}} 柚子</button>
      <button wx:elif="{{item.action === 'equipped'}}" class="owned" disabled>使用中</button>
      <button wx:elif="{{item.action === 'equip'}}" class="owned" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="equip">使用</button>
      <button wx:elif="{{item.action === 'owned'}}" class="owned" disabled>已解锁 · 在设置里选声音</button>
      <button wx:else disabled="{{!item.canBuy}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="buy">{{item.priceDisplay}} 柚子 · {{item.canBuy ? '购买' : '余额不足'}}</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</scroll-view>
